            "id": "n5",
            "target": "deck.cover",
            "text": "On the deck cover the hero tear line and the footer tear line sit next to each other and the footer text crowds them. Use where \"hero\" only or give the footer room.",
            "status": "open"
          },
          {
            "id": "n6",
            "target": "general",
            "text": "Leftover template text: meta.fonts.why, build.pressText, build.icons, build.appIcon and rules.do/dont still hold placeholder sentences. Write them for this look.",
            "status": "open"
          },
          {
            "id": "n7",
            "target": "kit.button-primary",
            "text": "The speckle wear on stamped buttons is even and reads as noise at small sizes; try fewer, larger flecks along the edge only.",
            "status": "open"
          }
        ]
      }
